From: AMCL Maintainers <amcl@local>
Subject: [PATCH] Register OHAudio backend in OpenAL Soft

Adds the OHAudio backend (HarmonyOS NEXT, API 12+) to OpenAL Soft 1.24.3:

  1. alc/alc.cpp: include "ohaudio.h" alongside other backend headers
  2. alc/alc.cpp: register BackendInfo{"ohaudio", OHAudioBackendFactory::getFactory}
     in BackendList[], guarded by HAVE_OHAUDIO

HAVE_OHAUDIO is defined via target_compile_definitions in
entry/src/main/cpp/openal/CMakeLists.txt rather than via configure_file
(config_backends.h.in resets all HAVE_xxx to 0).

This patch replaces the sed -i injection that lived in setup_deps.sh until
2026-05-15, which silently no-op'd whenever upstream alc.cpp was reformatted.

---
diff --git a/alc/alc.cpp b/alc/alc.cpp
index b55fce8..010de54 100644
--- a/alc/alc.cpp
+++ b/alc/alc.cpp
@@ -109,6 +109,9 @@
 
 #include "backends/base.h"
 #include "backends/null.h"
+#if HAVE_OHAUDIO
+#include "ohaudio.h"
+#endif
 #include "backends/loopback.h"
 #if HAVE_PIPEWIRE
 #include "backends/pipewire.h"
@@ -269,6 +272,9 @@ std::array BackendList{
     BackendInfo{"otherio", OtherIOBackendFactory::getFactory},
 #endif
 
+#if HAVE_OHAUDIO
+    BackendInfo{"ohaudio", OHAudioBackendFactory::getFactory},
+#endif
     BackendInfo{"null", NullBackendFactory::getFactory},
 #if HAVE_WAVE
     BackendInfo{"wave", WaveBackendFactory::getFactory},
